==Spanish==

===Etymology===
{{etyl|la}} {{term|probare|probāre|lang=la}}, present active infinitive of {{term|probo|probō|lang=la}}.

===Verb===
{{es-verb-ar|stem=prob}}

# To [[prove]]: "No puedes probarlo" (you can’t prove it)
# To [[taste]]: "Prueba a ver si está bueno (Taste it to see if it’s good)
# To [[try]]: "Lo probó todo sin éxito" (He tried everything without success)
# (''with clothes and similar'') To see if it [[fit]]s: "María se probó el vestido"

